Cell["\<\
For the variance contract, we follow the steps of Algorithm 1 in detail up to \
fourth order.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999004367834618*^9, 3.999004421622431*^9}, {
  3.9990157240781183`*^9, 3.999015732445562*^9}, {3.9990157711724052`*^9, 
